                      "start":  277.392814981042,
                      "end":  279.53074425443,
                      "interval":  94,
                      "en":  "Have you got a thermometer at home?",
                      "id":  "089"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  280.339928112186,
                      "end":  281.339928112186,
                      "interval":  86,
                      "en":  "No.",
                      "id":  "090"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  281.247984523717,
                      "end":  290.948992365152,
                      "interval":  96,
                      "en":  "OK. It would be helpful if you could get a thermometer from the pharmacy and, do check your temperature, just to make sure that it isn\u0027t, going up and down.",
                      "id":  "091"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  290.723454665114,
                      "end":  291.625709512479,
                      "interval":  88,
                      "en":  "OK.",
                      "id":  "092"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  290.948992365152,
                      "end":  298.645993045273,
                      "interval":  97,
                      "en":  "Um, normally we can treat this infection without having to test your urine. Uh, with, with a course of antibiotics.",
                      "id":  "093"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  299.189672454817,
                      "end":  300.497945628512,
                      "interval":  90,
                      "en":  "OK.",
                      "id":  "094"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  300.33079482728,
                      "end":  304.55829791844,
                      "interval":  99,
                      "en":  "Um, how do you feel about that? Are you happy to take a course of antibiotics?",
                      "id":  "095"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  304.535564218094,
                      "end":  305.979176833899,
                      "interval":  92,
                      "en":  "Yes I would be.",
                      "id":  "096"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  305.742039304957,
                      "end":  307.910019964404,
                      "interval":  101,
                      "en":  "It would just be for three days.",
                      "id":  "097"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  308.294976965524,
                      "end":  309.182194097099,
                      "interval":  94,
                      "en":  "OK.",
                      "id":  "098"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  309.792777218912,
                      "end":  310.792777218912,
                      "interval":  103,
                      "en":  "Um.",
                      "id":  "099"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  310.112426363919,
                      "end":  312.15964562345,
                      "interval":  96,
                      "en":  "\u003cINAUDIBLE_SPEECH/\u003e, get my prescription.",
                      "id":  "100"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  312.261742010369,
                      "end":  323.269741946061,
                      "interval":  105,
                      "en":  "Yes, so I can send a prescription through to your requested pharmacy for that. If you take them, as soon as you can, get them, pick them up as soon as you can, and start taking them.",
                      "id":  "101"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  323.269741946061,
                      "end":  330.144474502824,
                      "interval":  106,
                      "en":  "The other thing which is important to do is to drink, lots of water. So, two and a half to three litres a day.",
                      "id":  "102"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  327.866531666076,
                      "end":  328.543220776591,
                      "interval":  98,
                      "en":  "\u003cINAUDIBLE_SPEECH/\u003e",
                      "id":  "103"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  330.144474502824,
                      "end":  346.79962268823,
                      "interval":  107,
                      "en":  "Um, you can get some cranberry juice and take, drink that as well, that sometimes helps. And also some, sachets um, which you can get from the chemist, some sachets which just help change the acidity of your urine. So I, I can put the details of that on your notes.",
                      "id":  "104"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  330.144729408192,
                      "end":  330.791343087126,
                      "interval":  100,
                      "en":  "Yeah.",
                      "id":  "105"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  346.836577735028,
                      "end":  347.911766313978,
                      "interval":  102,
                      "en":  "OK then.",
                      "id":  "106"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  347.830485681334,
                      "end":  363.558797782174,
                      "interval":  109,
                      "en":  "Um, if you feel like your pain is getting worse or not settling, you get lower back pain, um, or you\u0027re getting a high temperature, or you have any problems actually passing urine. Then it\u0027s very important that we speak to you again.",
                      "id":  "107"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  363.723916367135,
                      "end":  364.723916367135,
                      "interval":  104,
                      "en":  "OK.",
                      "id":  "108"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  364.6027984916,
                      "end":  371.33752193763,
                      "interval":  111,
                      "en":  "Um, the other thing is that if it becomes a, common, thing or a recurrent problem. Then we need to talk to you again about it.",
                      "id":  "109"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  371.979606135777,
                      "end":  375.536017820078,
                      "interval":  106,
                      "en":  "So, do I have to call after I finish my course of antibiotics.",
                      "id":  "110"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "doctor",
                      "start":  374.889242126441,
                      "end":  395.834041940726,
                      "interval":  113,
                      "en":  "No, not if you\u0027re better. If you\u0027re, if you feel like your symptoms get worse at any point, or they\u0027re not resolving with the treatment. Or you keep getting a similar, um, you keep getting a similar, problem, reccurently. Then it\u0027s important for us to talk, talk to you in more detail about that.",
                      "id":  "111"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  376.701432693768,
                      "end":  377.618725256923,
                      "interval":  108,
                      "en":  "OK.",
                      "id":  "112"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  390.175209841544,
                      "end":  390.919568673113,
                      "interval":  110,
                      "en":  "Yeah.",
                      "id":  "113"
                  },
                  {
                      "speaker":  "patient",
                      "start":  396.069978231155,
                      "end":  397.069978231155,
                      "interval":  112,
                      "en":  "OK then.",
